WEBVTT

00:00:00.559 --> 00:00:03.098
Lolly is a Production Studio

00:00:03.911 --> 00:00:06.846
Serving at the Crossroads of civilization,

00:00:06.846 --> 00:00:10.759
as a Refuge of all the arts against the ravages of time.

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:15.388
Armoury of fearless truth against whispering rumour

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.829
and the Incessant trumpet of trade

00:00:18.674 --> 00:00:21.950
From this place, your ideas fly forward.

00:00:22.705 --> 00:00:25.002
Not to perish on shores of change,

00:00:25.375 --> 00:00:27.305
Not to vary without evidence

00:00:27.764 --> 00:00:29.350
but fixed in time

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:33.333
having been verified in proof.

00:00:33.919 --> 00:00:37.381
Friend you behold a legacy honoured:

00:00:37.801 --> 00:00:39.806
Lolly is a Production Studio
